<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (The Personalized Travel Itinerary Planner harnesses Generative AI and geospatial optimization to provide intelligent, hyper-personalized travel planning, transforming abstract travel desires \("chill sunsets", "high-adrenaline adventure", "Michelin street foodie", "deep cultural immersion"\) into day-by-day, geographically optimized, and budget-conscious travel itineraries.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
