/S /P
/P 507 0 R
/E (Vibe & Preference Engine: Evaluates traveler pace, budget caps, companion style, and niche aesthetic vibes with multi-dimensional vector compatibility scoring.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 508 0 R
/E (AI Itinerary Generator: Powered by Google Gemini 2.5 Flash, synthesizing structured morning-to-night schedules with duration counters, estimated activity costs, and local insider tips.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 509 0 R
/E (Route & Time Optimizer: Employs the Haversine formula and a 2-opt TSP \(Traveling Salesperson Problem\) heuristic algorithm to eliminate zigzagging and minimize daily transit time.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 510 0 R
/E (Dynamic Vibe Sliders: Allows on-the-fly itinerary recalibration \(+40% Adventure, Sunset & Chill Mode, Budget-friendly swaps\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
