/P 143 0 R
/E (Built with a high-performance FastAPI \(Python 3.11\) backend, a luxury glassmorphism React 18 + Vite frontend, and persistent Supabase PostgreSQL cloud storage, the platform is publicly deployed on Vercel \(Frontend\) and Render \(Backend\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
