/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (A user has 3 days in Kyoto and selects a Relaxed pace with a Sunset & Chill vibe and moderate budget. The AI generates a serene morning-to-evening schedule featuring quiet temple gardens, canal-side matcha cafes, and sunset viewpoint spots. The Route Optimizer groups nearby Higashiyama spots together, saving 2+ hours of transit. The traveler syncs the schedule directly into their Google Calendar via .ics.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
