/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (A group of college friends planning a 4-day trip to Queenstown, New Zealand selects Fast-Paced, Adventure, and a strict budget cap of $80/day. The AI schedules bungee jumping, mountain biking trails, and scenic hikes, calculating activity entrance fees and local transport costs. When the group wants more downtime on Day 3, they slide the dynamic vibe slider to +30% Chill, instantly swapping a strenuous climb for a lakeside lounge.)
/Pg 10 0 R
